#
# LEF/DEF -> GDS layer map for the DEF stream (scripts/def2stream.py), in the
# EDI map format KLayout's LEF/DEF reader takes as `map_file` (the format
# croc's klayout/sg13cmos5l.map uses). Change stream-final-gds, design D3.
#
# GDS numbers are the IHP SG13G2 ones, checked against the PDK's
# libs.tech/klayout/tech/sg13g2.lyp (<Layer>.drw = n/0, <Metal>.txt = n/25).
#
# Kept to mask data plus pin names:
# - routing (NET), special routing (SPNET, the power grid), DEF pins (PIN)
#   and via geometry (VIA) go on the drawing datatype, as in the scratch DRC
#   probe whose GDS the 2026-11-24/25 signoff DRC ran on;
# - each top-level pin's name is a text on its metal's .txt datatype (25);
# - no LEF pins, obstructions, fills or cell/die outlines: the LEF cells are
#   replaced by their GDS, and the rest are LEF/DEF abstractions, not masks.
#   The pin purpose (n/2, croc writes it too) is for LVS, added with it.
#
#EDI Layer Name  EDI Layer Type      GDS Layer Number   GDS Layer Type
#==============  ==============      ================   ==============

Metal1           NET,SPNET,PIN,VIA   8                  0
NAME             Metal1/PIN          8                  25
Via1             VIA                 19                 0

Metal2           NET,SPNET,PIN,VIA   10                 0
NAME             Metal2/PIN          10                 25
Via2             VIA                 29                 0

Metal3           NET,SPNET,PIN,VIA   30                 0
NAME             Metal3/PIN          30                 25
Via3             VIA                 49                 0

Metal4           NET,SPNET,PIN,VIA   50                 0
NAME             Metal4/PIN          50                 25
Via4             VIA                 66                 0

Metal5           NET,SPNET,PIN,VIA   67                 0
NAME             Metal5/PIN          67                 25
TopVia1          VIA                 125                0

TopMetal1        NET,SPNET,PIN,VIA   126                0
NAME             TopMetal1/PIN       126                25
TopVia2          VIA                 133                0

TopMetal2        NET,SPNET,PIN,VIA   134                0
NAME             TopMetal2/PIN       134                25
